  "oifm_id": "OIFM_MGB_146898",
  "name": "glenohumeral joint degenerative changes",
  "description": "Degenerative osteoarthritic changes of the glenohumeral joint, including cartilage loss, osteophyte formation, subchondral sclerosis and cysts, loose joint bodies, and associated findings such as effusion, glenoid fracture, or rotator cuff calcification.",
